  "content_description": "",
  "content_text_body": "With training, your team members will have more success executing on their goals. The objective is to help your team members find and access the training they need to be effective in their jobs.\n\nTraining does not have to be formal. Peer-to-peer learning works great. Do you have team members who consistently execute well? What can the rest of the team learn from them? Shadowing works particularly well - observing is a more effective way to learn than simply being told what to do.  \n\nAfter observing and learning from others, it is important that you and your team members start practicing new ways to execute immediately. You will see what works for you and doesn't and be able to share those experiences with each other.",
